BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail Pointer Arithmetic rules in C, explaining scaling by sizeof\(*ptr\), pointer difference \(ptrdiff_t\), and illegal operations.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Pointer Arithmetic Mechanics in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Scaling Principle:) Tj
T*
(   Pointer arithmetic does NOT advance by raw bytes! It advances by WHOLE ELEMENTS based on the) Tj
T*
(   byte footprint of the pointed type:) Tj
T*
(   Formula: ptr + n = RawAddress + \(n * sizeof\(*ptr\)\)) Tj
T*
(   - If int *p = 1000 and sizeof\(int\) = 4:) Tj
T*
(   p + 1 evaluates to memory address 1004.) Tj
T*
(   p + 3 evaluates to memory address 1012.) Tj
T*
(   - If double *dp = 2000 and sizeof\(double\) = 8:) Tj
T*
(   dp + 1 evaluates to memory address 2008.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Pointer Subtraction \(ptrdiff_t\):) Tj
T*
(   - Subtracting two pointers pointing to elements within the same array computes the distance in) Tj
T*
(   NUMBER OF ELEMENTS between them:) Tj
T*
(   ptrdiff_t distance = p2 - p1;) Tj
T*
(   Formula: \(Address\(p2\) - Address\(p1\)\) / sizeof\(*p1\).) Tj
T*
(   - Defined in <stddef.h>, printed using %td.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Strict Rules: Legal vs Illegal Operations:) Tj
T*
(   - Legal Operations:) Tj
T*
(   a. Adding an integer to a pointer: ptr + n) Tj
T*
(   b. Subtracting an integer from a pointer: ptr - n) Tj
T*
(   c. Subtracting two pointers of the exact same type: ptr2 - ptr1) Tj
T*
(   d. Comparing two pointers \(<, <=, >, >=, ==, !=\) within the same array object.) Tj
T*
(   - Strictly Illegal Operations \(Cause compilation errors\):) Tj
T*
(   a. Adding two pointers \(ptr1 + ptr2 is meaningless in physics/logic\).) Tj
T*
(   b. Multiplying, dividing, or modulo between pointers.) Tj
T*
(   c. Bitwise operations \(&, |, ^, ~, <<, >>\) directly on pointer variables.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Demonstrative ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <stddef.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int buffer[8] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80};) Tj
T*
(   int *p_start = &buffer[1]; /* Points to 20 */) Tj
T*
(   int *p_end = &buffer[6]; /* Points to 70 */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ptrdiff_t diff = p_end - p_start;) Tj
T*
(   printf\("p_start address: %p | Val: %d\\n", \(void *\)p_start, *p_start\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("p_end address: %p | Val: %d\\n", \(void *\)p_end, *p_end\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Distance in elements \(p_end - p_start\): %td elements\\n", diff\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Raw byte span: %td bytes\\n", \(char *\)p_end - \(char *\)p_start\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

