BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the equivalence between Arrays and Pointers in C, detailing array decay, ptr[i] vs *\(ptr + i\), and the 2[arr] curiosity.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Equivalence of Arrays and Pointers in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Array Decay Invariant:) Tj
T*
(   In almost all expression contexts, an array identifier automatically decays into a constant) Tj
T*
(   pointer to its first element \(&arr[0]\).) Tj
T*
(   \(Exceptions: when used as operand to sizeof, unary &, or string literal initializer\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Subscript Equivalence Axiom:) Tj
T*
(   In ANSI C, the square bracket array subscript operator is defined strictly as syntactic sugar) Tj
T*
(   for pointer arithmetic:) Tj
T*
(   E1[E2] is syntactically identical to: *\(\(E1\) + \(E2\)\)) Tj
T*
(   - arr[i] == *\(arr + i\)) Tj
T*
(   - Pointer can be indexed like an array:) Tj
T*
(   int *p = arr;) Tj
T*
(   p[3] == *\(p + 3\) == arr[3].) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The 2[arr] Syntactical Curiosity:) Tj
T*
(   Because mathematical addition \(+\) is commutative:) Tj
T*
(   *\(arr + 2\) == *\(2 + arr\)) Tj
T*
(   Applying the definition of subscripting in reverse:) Tj
T*
(   *\(2 + arr\) == 2[arr]!) Tj
T*
(   Writing 2[arr] is 100% valid ANSI C code and produces the exact same element as arr[2]!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Demonstrative ANSI C Program:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   int primers[5] = {100, 200, 300, 400, 500};) Tj
T*
(   int *ptr = primers;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   printf\("Standard Subscript arr[2]: %d\\n", primers[2]\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Pointer Dereference *\(arr + 2\): %d\\n", *\(primers + 2\)\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Pointer Subscript ptr[2]: %d\\n", ptr[2]\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Commutative Subscript 2[arr]: %d \(Valid ANSI C!\)\\n", 2[primers]\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Commutative Subscript 2[ptr]: %d\\n", 2[ptr]\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
