(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   In-Place Word Reversal in a Sentence:) Tj
T*
(   1. Two-Step Inversion Algorithm:) Tj
T*
(   To reverse words in a sentence \("Biotechnology Is Fun" -> "Fun Is Biotechnology"\) in-place in) Tj
T*
(   O\(N\) time and O\(1\) space:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Reverse each individual word in-place:) Tj
T*
(   "ygolonhcetoiB sI nuF") Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Reverse the entire sentence string:) Tj
T*
(   "Fun Is Biotechnology"!) Tj
