(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program to implement a Custom Fixed-Size Memory Arena \(Bump Allocator\) for ultra-fast allocations without fragmentation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Custom Memory Arena \(Bump Allocator\) in C:) Tj
T*
(   1. Concept and Advantages:) Tj
T*
(   In high-performance bioinformatics pipelines \(e.g. processing millions of short sequencing) Tj
T*
(   reads\), calling malloc\(\) millions of times incurs catastrophic metadata overhead and memory) Tj
T*
(   fragmentation.) Tj
T*
(   A Memory Arena pre-allocates a large contiguous memory slab and satisfies allocations by simply) Tj
T*
(   bumping an offset pointer forward:) Tj
T*
(   - Allocation Time: Exactly O\(1\) single pointer addition!) Tj
T*
(   - Deallocation: The entire arena is reclaimed in O\(1\) time by resetting the offset to zero!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Complete ANSI C Source Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdlib.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdint.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   typedef struct {) Tj
T*
(   uint8_t *buffer;) Tj
T*
(   size_t capacity;) Tj
T*
(   size_t offset;) Tj
T*
(   } MemoryArena;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   MemoryArena *create_arena\(size_t capacity\) {) Tj
T*
(   MemoryArena *arena = \(MemoryArena *\)malloc\(sizeof\(MemoryArena\)\);) Tj
T*
(   arena->buffer = \(uint8_t *\)malloc\(capacity\);) Tj
T*
(   arena->capacity = capacity;) Tj
T*
(   arena->offset = 0;) Tj
T*
(   return arena;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void *arena_alloc\(MemoryArena *arena, size_t size\) {) Tj
T*
(   /* Align size to 8-byte boundary */) Tj
T*
(   size = \(size + 7\) & ~7;) Tj
T*
(   if \(arena->offset + size > arena->capacity\) {) Tj
T*
(   return NULL; /* Out of arena memory */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   void *ptr = &arena->buffer[arena->offset];) Tj
T*
(   arena->offset += size;) Tj
T*
(   return ptr;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void arena_reset\(MemoryArena *arena\) {) Tj
T*
(   arena->offset = 0; /* Instant O\(1\) reclamation */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void destroy_arena\(MemoryArena *arena\) {) Tj
T*
(   free\(arena->buffer\);) Tj
T*
(   free\(arena\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   MemoryArena *arena = create_arena\(1024\);) Tj
T*
